Z||000003||Master_Sushi||11-17-2001||12:13 AM||||HaHa, don't feel bad. My 84 is WAY more rusted then that. My trunk is mostly bent sheet metal that’s been riveted in  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. My strut towers are almost gone.... ect ect lol<P>Check your frame over for rust. Maybe take out the rear wheel-well liners. This is where things seem to get really bad/dangerous! Good luck fixing it, it looks mostly repairable.<BR>||||reg||11
Z||000004||FieroBUZZ||11-17-2001||08:56 AM||||Could be worse, make sure the rear strut towers are solid or they might fall off like mine.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bigrust.jpg"> <P>Gary||||reg||1
