Z||000009||Hank is Here||11-20-2001||12:09 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by firstfiero:<BR><B>      I have a northern daily driver and I don't have an inch of rust! At least known that I know of   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't think Pa qualifies.  My 87 GT and Dad's 88Gt Pa daily drivers have no rust at all.  My 88 coupe has minimal rust on the battery tray and left of the trunk---no holes though just bubbling metal <P><BR>Hank <BR>||||reg||1
